{"data": [{"author_id": "1792690788326952960", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:09:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117393672199082148"], "id": "2117393672199082148", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117226039998906520", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus @chetaslua &gt;is it just a good model or is it gonna change the entire game?\n&gt;laughs\n&gt;it's gonna change the game sir\n&gt;looks inside\n&gt;it's a good model", "url": "https://x.com/sooskars/status/2117393672199082148"}, {"author_id": "1106896608", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:29:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117383614451372523"], "id": "2117383614451372523", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1993270634080874496", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117226801298563255", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PawelJLisowski @kimmonismus @chetaslua Or paying them to pump. \n\nNotice how no one trusts anything? \n\nYeah, that’s thanks to the labs. That’s their legacy. Broken trust. Division. Fear. \n\nHope you’re proud @AnthropicAI and @OpenAI and none of the labs are blameless. \n\nEverything should have been done without endless", "url": "https://x.com/Chaos2Cured/status/2117383614451372523"}, {"author_id": "180848844", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:29:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117383546146865542"], "id": "2117383546146865542", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117226039998906520", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus @chetaslua the demo looks wild but i want to see it handle messy real-world code before calling it a game changer", "url": "https://x.com/Bagdex/status/2117383546146865542"}, {"author_id": "1715403757482016768", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:20:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117381288202264644"], "id": "2117381288202264644", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117226039998906520", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus @chetaslua Claiming it's the \"latest Fable 5.5 checkpoint\" sounds very certain, but is the observable code truly indicative of a game-changing release, or just incremental refinement?", "url": "https://x.com/sofiesoftly_p/status/2117381288202264644"}, {"author_id": "1000475895084273664", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:02:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117376755250192831"], "id": "2117376755250192831", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1010623768585211905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117375644296257835", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SamSwidzinski @kimmonismus @chetaslua Going to be epic", "url": "https://x.com/mjl11061/status/2117376755250192831"}, {"author_id": "1010623768585211905", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:57:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117375644296257835"], "id": "2117375644296257835", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117226039998906520", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus @chetaslua @mjl11061", "url": "https://x.com/SamSwidzinski/status/2117375644296257835"}, {"author_id": "472614690", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:24:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117367381337190769"], "id": "2117367